        "headline": "Flood Advisory issued May 28 at 7:05PM AKDT until May 28 at 10:00PM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...Flooding caused by excessive rainfall is expected.\n\n* WHERE...Including the following area, Fairbanks Metro Area.\n\n* WHEN...Until 1000 PM AKDT.\n\n* IMPACTS...Minor flooding in low-lying and poor drainage areas.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n- At 703 PM AKDT, trained weather spotters reported heavy rain\nin the advisory area. Minor flooding, pooling, and ponding of\nwater is ongoing or expected to begin shortly. Between 0.5\nand 1 inch of rain has fallen. The expected rainfall rate is\n0.5-1 inch ",
